  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A sled of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> is pulled across a horizontal surface by a force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P\"></span> directed at an angle <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta\"></span> above the horizontal. If the sled remains in contact with the ground, which expression represents the magnitude of the normal reaction force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span> exerted by the surface on the sled?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m g\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m g + P \\sin \\theta\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m g - P \\sin \\theta\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P \\cos \\theta\"></span></p></li></ol>"
  },
